<title>USA: IACA names site finalists for 20th Air Cargo Forum.</title>
<headline>IACA names site finalists for 20th Air Cargo Forum.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Air Cargo Association (TIACA) have named Los Angeles, Miami and Washington D.C., the finalists for the site of the 20th International Air Cargo Forum and Exposition in the year 2000.</p>
<p>The TIACA said the decision will be announced at its annual general meeting in London on 4-5 December 1997.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
